staff:Fdd08_1EemDoc a sd:SourceDocument ; sd:docType "fdd" ;
    sd:section "functional-design-docs/08 - Interface and Integrations Setup/8.1 - EEM Interface/8.1 - EEM Interface IDD.docx" ;
    sd:notes "REST API (Bearer Token) integration spec against CEPI.PublicServices/api/EntityInformation/{method}. 6 review comments, all editorial TBD-field nagging plus one dead-link fix — no requirement-level content." .
orgs:Fdd08_1EntityDirDoc a sd:SourceDocument ; sd:docType "fdd" ;
    sd:section "functional-design-docs/08 - Interface and Integrations Setup/8.1 - EEM Interface/8.1 - Entity Directory Data Population IDD.docx" ;
    sd:notes "A DIFFERENT, separately-specified mechanism for the same underlying goal (EEM entity data into MiEdWorkforce): a Synapse ETL pipeline reading EEM's SQL tables directly (Managed Identity auth, no REST layer) and populating CEDS IDS tables, explicitly built to 'remove the dependency on the CEPI Public Service EEM Entity Information services' that the sibling 8.1 EEM Interface IDD describes. See Question_EemIntegrationMechanismDiscrepancy below — three different described mechanisms exist across this folder plus the real organizations-domain build. 9 review comments, all editorial TBD-field nagging." .
